1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,917
This is an animated demo, not a real scan. Choose RoomPlan for interiors, or LiDAR scanning for textures and gates.

2
00:00:08,917 --> 00:00:16,882
Walk slowly through one room. Show the floor, walls, doors and windows. Follow the camera guidance during RoomPlan capture.

3
00:00:16,882 --> 00:00:24,650
Finish capture and name the building, floor and room. Save the files. Each room keeps its own separate coordinate system.

4
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:33,904
Open the Kantura room file on your computer and add more rooms. Inspect surfaces, visible gaps and the imported dimensions.

5
00:00:33,904 --> 00:00:40,894
Select a distance and measure it with a tape too. Enter that reference length; Kantura displays the difference.

6
00:00:40,894 --> 00:00:48,105
Place a note on the model. Add a description and photo to explain the location. A photo is not another measurement.

7
00:00:48,105 --> 00:00:56,163
Download the report and print it to PDF. Save the project locally, to configured cloud storage or your Docker server.

8
00:00:56,163 --> 00:01:06,915
Transport checks simplified envelopes. Individual steps, railings and carriers are not calculated. Check the real route and the manufacturer’s instructions.
